JNDI-based variant of <a href="../CustomizableThreadFactory.html" title="class in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent"><code>CustomizableThreadFactory</code></a>, performing a default lookup
for JSR-236's "java:comp/DefaultManagedThreadFactory" in a Jakarta EE environment,
falling back to the local <a href="../CustomizableThreadFactory.html" title="class in org.springframework.scheduling.concurrent"><code>CustomizableThreadFactory</code></a> setup if not found.
